      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Reference is made to the Mayor's Executive Order #25 dated August 2, 1955, which outlined the procedure to be followed in submitting proposed State legislation to be included in the City's 1956 legislative program, and established October 15th, as the date for submitting such bills for consideration by this office.",
