      "text": "The purpose of this memorandum is to again call the matter to your attention for appropriate action. In cases where the October date was not met, you are requested to notify Victor F. Condello, Assistant to the Mayor, of any legislative proposals presently under consideration by your agency, and the estimated date by which they will be submitted to this office.",
